# The Witch III shelf: every one of its twenty toys plays, a band of them with both conductors
# sounds sane, and the shelf's third page lists them.
wait 100
seat 1 heart 1234
seat 2 bodybass 77
seat 3 afterhours 5
seat 4 hexbell 9
seat 5 storm 3
seat 6 toll 8
seat 7 fog 1
seat 8 dubout 2
expect seated 8
wav witch3.wav
tap PLAY
wait 16000
expect playing 1
expect notes >80
expect peak_db_min -30
expect peak_db_max 0
wavstop
tap PLAY
wait 100
